{"protocol":"mindblown-brain/1","brain":"projects","page":{"id":"projects/ledgerline-demo","title":"Ledgerline Demo","type":"project","lobe":"ledger","parent":null,"desc":"Fictional public presentation and separately scoped sample previews.","intro":"Fictional public presentation and separately scoped sample previews.","created":"2026-10-08","updated":"2026-10-28","synapses":["projects/ledgerline-demo#1","projects/ledgerline-demo#2","projects/ledgerline-demo#3","projects/ledgerline-demo#4","projects/ledgerline-demo#5","projects/ledgerline-demo#6","projects/ledgerline-demo#7","projects/ledgerline-demo#8"],"sources":["pplx://sessions/dc95a4b6-262c-ed5d-895e-3e73c0c99ded","pplx://sessions/95e42275-7df0-9a0b-7cbf-7c73cb018066","pplx://sessions/99735ec7-d1e1-3bef-4f90-47833ad4a401","pplx://sessions/d7347079-d532-48e0-8f71-99d6f6e5148b","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/ledgerline/pull/39","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/ledgerline/pull/16"],"sections":["How it works","See also"]},"url":"https://mindblown.pplx.app/index.html#n=projects%2Fledgerline-demo","parent":null,"children":[],"synapses":[{"id":"projects/ledgerline-demo#1","page":"projects/ledgerline-demo","lead":"Reusable duplicate guard","text":"Sam chose to keep the duplicate guard and the page image distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://git.example.test/sam-vale/ledgerline/pull/16"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-demo#2","page":"projects/ledgerline-demo","lead":"Year report needs an owner choice","text":"the year report merges before cutover and surfaces a plain warning when the register row is missing. Manual confirmation is still required.","section":"How it works","links":["projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync"],"cites":["pplx://sessions/d7347079-d532-48e0-8f71-99d6f6e5148b"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-demo#3","page":"projects/ledgerline-demo","lead":"Page image is not acceptance","text":"the page image imports before cutover, but this does not establish tracking entry acceptance or a new release. Review notes remain separate from the shipped build.","section":"How it works","links":["projects/ledgerline-mobile"],"cites":["pplx://sessions/99735ec7-d1e1-3bef-4f90-47833ad4a401"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-demo#4","page":"projects/ledgerline-demo","lead":"Protected register row","text":"Sam chose to keep the register row and the rollback bundle distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":["projects/ledgerline-document-upload"],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-demo#5","page":"projects/ledgerline-demo","lead":"Reusable year report","text":"the register row is derived from the year report per tax year; exports include it, imports tolerate its absence and nothing is deleted on the way through.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-demo#6","page":"projects/ledgerline-demo","lead":"Default-off duplicate guard","text":"an earlier draft treated the duplicate guard as complete; later turns supersede that, and the current state is a tested candidate awaiting the owner's go-ahead.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-demo#7","page":"projects/ledgerline-demo","lead":"Reusable weekly CSV","text":"Sam chose to keep the weekly CSV and the duplicate guard distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/d7347079-d532-48e0-8f71-99d6f6e5148b"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-demo#8","page":"projects/ledgerline-demo","lead":"No silent tracking entry changes","text":"the tracking entry exports before cutover and surfaces a plain warning when the rollback bundle is missing. Manual confirmation is still required.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://git.example